WEBVTT

00:05:00.921 --> 00:05:02.673
People checked their critical minds

00:05:02.715 --> 00:05:05.593
and really unleashed that joy from within,

00:05:05.634 --> 00:05:08.429
doing these goofy dance moves,

00:05:08.471 --> 00:05:10.639
while the world was in disarray.

00:05:10.681 --> 00:05:11.849
Take a look.

00:05:11.849 --> 00:05:13.017
(Music)

00:05:24.528 --> 00:05:25.780
(Music ends)

00:05:25.821 --> 00:05:26.864
(Laughs)

00:05:26.864 --> 00:05:29.575
Who would have guessed
that moves like the Pretty Pony

00:05:29.575 --> 00:05:30.868
and the Bob Ross ...